  (text "Gate drive: U7 OR3 (OV | U16 | FORCE) → U9 UCC27524 (A: clamp, B: K1 coil Q4)" (at 214.9555 40 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f12fd851-cb26-5756-91ea-d030eedd068e"))
  (text "Clamp comparator U4 (A: OV on/off, B: PRE_OK) + TL431B reference" (at 214.9555 158.5175 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c50af9d3-720c-5f90-bd62-6c45a8db9c8f"))
  (text "Clamp window from electrical.py CLAMP: on 26.00 V, off 25.70 V; drawn values give on 25.982 V / off 25.684 V (E96 0.1 %).\nGate = OV | U16 (50 us minimum on-time, triggered by OV rising) | FORCE, through U7 -> U9 OUTA -> R11-R13 -> Q1-Q3.\nFreewheel: D4-D6 anodes (pins 1 + 3) at each drain, cathode (pin 2 + tab) at VBUS: across each NH-50 (finding 1).\nLoop to minimise on the board: C2 -> J10 -> (NH-50 leads, off-board) -> J7-J9 -> D4-D6 / Q1-Q3 -> PGND -> C2." (at 25.4 388 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f797f692-2e8a-5a8a-be5a-580fcdc1c6b7"))
  (symbol (lib_id "Connector_Generic:Conn_01x01") (at 44.45 50.8 0) (unit 1)
    (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no)
